  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Partner Driven cooperation project between Uppsala University, Department of Education, Sweden; Hanoi National University of Education and Vietnam Institute of Education Sciences, Vietnam. The partners want to establish and develop a long-term cooperation in research and developing climate change education and education for sustainable development in both countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akt&#xF6;rssamverkansprojekt mellan Uppsala Universitet, Hanoi National University of Education och Vietnam Institute of Education Sciences. Partnerna planerar att etablera och utveckla en l&#xE5;ngsiktigt samarbete inom forskning och utveckling av utbildning inom klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring och h&#xE5;llbar utveckling i b&#xE5;da l&#xE4;nderna.</narrative>
  </description>
